<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ptĕlĕum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-on</span></b> , i, n.,
		and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ptĕlĕŏs</span></b> , i,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πτελεόν</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A port in Thessaly</i>, <i>over
				against Eubœa</i>, now <i>Pteleo</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Mel.
				2, 3, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 35, 43</span></i>; <i><span class="en">42, 67</span></i>.—Form
			Pteleos, <i><span class="en">Luc. 6, 352</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A city in Messenia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5,
				7, § 15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A city in Ionia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 29,
				31, § 115</span></i> (al. Ptelea).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
